{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12242090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12242090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1224209001:0":{"text":"Stop, everyone! I'm not here to deal with this mess!","source_cn":"都住手！我不是来替你们收拾烂摊子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25575DEFAAE1AF24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224209002:0":{"text":"All dockworkers, listen up—we Carmine Whispers aren't taking over the docks! Sonja's just trying to restore Rustport to its former glory!","source_cn":"码头上的工人都听好了：血薇帮不会独占码头，我们当家的是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0C2080963DEC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224209003:0":{"text":"We've only sent a few foremen here so the construction won't affect your livelihood!","source_cn":"我们只派了几个工头，是有考虑到你们还要靠码头吃饭的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE498ECA519B83E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224209004:0":{"text":"You should appreciate our efforts instead of trying to hinder the construction! Do you want the port to be closed off forever?!","source_cn":"你们不领情，还在这里阻碍施工！怎么，不想港口开放，就想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F0261748E512F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224209005:0":{"text":"You're so full of hot air!","source_cn":"——净说没用的屁话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45F96B5A752B329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224209006:0":{"text":"Rustport ended up this way because of you lot! You were the ones who ordered the lockdown, and now you're also the ones pushing for its rebuild!","source_cn":"锈锚港现在这德行，不都归功于你们血薇帮吗！当初下令封锁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802CBD3D6BF1BD5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224209007:0":{"text":"Exactly! You have the final say, and we're always left to suffer because of your actions!","source_cn":"就是这个理！你们永远有理，我们一帮只知道卖力气的大老粗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B23B125D1C0C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224209008:0":{"text":"If it weren't for you, my family and friends could have joined a fleet and made a fortune!","source_cn":"要不是你们，我的家人兄弟就能跟着船队出海，说不定还能做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7E7029FF408BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224209009:0":{"text":"I can't reason with you...\nDo you really think being a maritime trader is as simple as collecting shellfish in the sea?!","source_cn":"你这个野蛮人……\\n真当出海贸易和下海捞贝壳一样简单？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x310A0DB6721BF4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224209010:0":{"text":"So many of us couldn't make it back from the sea... and then there was the threat of the Dead Tide Fleet! Remember what happened to those who fell into their hands?!","source_cn":"多少船只没有返航，多少人没命回到锈锚港……更别提之前还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9C166BEADC62FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224209011:0":{"text":"We don't care if you want to dig your own grave! But we can't let them take control of Rustport!","source_cn":"你愿意去送命，血薇帮不管！但整个锈锚港，不能交由他们处置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3654ADEEF33947A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224209012:0":{"text":"You!","source_cn":"你——！<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363B2E26B15866F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224209013:0":{"text":"Y—You've got a point, but something still feels off...","source_cn":"虽……虽然你说的话有道理，但话也不能这么说吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6440A4B35808D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1224209013":{"text":"Y—You've got a point, but something still feels off...","source_cn":"虽……虽然你说的话有道理，但话也不能这么说吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6440A4B35808D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224209014:0":{"text":"Despite all the nice things you say, you guys have taken over the docks anyway!","source_cn":"哼，大道理都让你们说了，码头也让你们占了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F87997E44D0EFDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224209015:0":{"text":"That's enough. I don't have time to bicker with you.","source_cn":"够了，我没空和你们争辩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE28B4C7ABE09051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224209016:0":{"text":"The wood's here. Waylan, get your men to start the repair work immediately. Don't waste your time in meaningless arguments again!","source_cn":"木材都运到了。韦兰，你赶快带人去修码头。别再让我抓到你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21088DD63A39184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224209017:0":{"text":"If these dockworkers refuse to cooperate, just let them be. I'll send more people your way.","source_cn":"至于这些码头工人——不乐意配合，那就让他们歇着。我再给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B23D634610A45F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224209018:0":{"text":"No problem!","source_cn":"是，我这就让弟兄们开始干！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2947AAD9EE2DEBDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1224209019:0":{"text":"Wait a minute... No one will hire us in the future if you do all the work here!","source_cn":"这……码头上的活儿要是都被你们干了，以后谁还来找我们啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE530925BFA7F2888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1224209020:0":{"text":"I—I'll help you!","source_cn":"我、我也来帮你们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7DE0D35E7C915DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210001:":{"text":"Chop-chop, everyone!","source_cn":"手脚都麻利点！动作快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C1E5E66E52E41B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210002:":{"text":"You have no chance to slack off; I'm watching you.","source_cn":"别想偷懒，我盯着你们呢","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD99CD090640E1ABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit